{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">環西班牙單車賽，雲艾特贏出第15站。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今站全長110公里，屬於起伏不斷的丘陵賽段，早段未有車手發力。總成績領先的馬斯，跟隨大集團返終點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0900.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026SlSrCgR5ah1788746077.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0900.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">距離終點約30公里，雲艾特發動突襲，五位車手形成領先集團。綠衫的雲艾特，跟隨另一車手，留守第二等待機會。最後發揮出爆炸力，這位比利時車手成功奪得他今屆第二個分站冠軍，進一步鞏固他在衝刺綠衫積分榜的領先位置。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西班牙的馬斯在總成績，有2分06秒領先優勢。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0900_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Tbiy6Q1Eyc1788746074.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.CYCLING.SPAIN-0900_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T02:19:20.473029+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}